      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Единственное тёплое действие экрана: «Решать», «Проверить», «Следующая задача».",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">Решать<span class=\"ds-ic\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 4l-1.4 1.4L16.2 11H4v2h12.2l-5.6 5.6L12 20l8-8z\"/></svg></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;height:56px;padding:0 28px;border:none;border-radius:28px;background:#f5a065;color:#0f2a3d;font:800 17px Manrope,Roboto,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .15s cubic-bezier(.2,0,0,1)}.ds-btn-primary:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #2a7590;outline-offset:3px}.ds-btn-primary .ds-ic{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#0f2a3d29}"
    },
    {
