      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Карточка возраста: крупное число, «лет», дорожка прогресса.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-card\"><span class=\"ds-n\">7<small>лет</small></span><span class=\"ds-meter\"><span class=\"ds-track\"><i></i></span>20 из 99</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;width:300px;padding:16px 18px;border:none;border-radius:20px;background:#f6ebcd;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #0f2a3d33;color:#0f2a3d;font-family:Manrope,Roboto,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;text-align:left}.ds-card:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #2a7590;outline-offset:3px}.ds-n{font-size:46px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:.9}.ds-n small{font-size:18px;margin-left:6px}.ds-meter{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;width:100%;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.ds-track{flex:1;height:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#0f2a3d1f;overflow:hidden}.ds-track i{display:block;width:20%;height:100%;background:#2a7590;border-radius:8px}"
    },
    {
